      "alt": "So Thea’s mummy said, “Would you like a drink?”\nAnd the shoggoth drank all the water in the fridge, and all the water in tap, and all the water in the swimming pool.\n\nThen he said, “Thank you for my nice training. I think, I’d better go now.”\n\nAnd he went.\n\nThea’s mummy said, “I don’t know what to do. I’ve got nothing for Daddy’s evening reading, the shoggoth has read it all.”\n\nAnd Thea found she couldn’t have her bath\nbecause the shoggoth had drunk all the water in the tap.",
